. 熟悉AI大模型应用落地流程，具备AI软件平台（如AI质检、智能排产、数字孪生等）实施经验；\n5. 具备良好的跨部门沟通与协调能力，能有效推动项目进展；\n6. 英语读写流利，具备与国际客户或团队协作的能力者优先；\n7. 有电池、储能、智能制造等领域AI应用经验者优先；\n8、熟悉工业物联网（IIoT）、边缘计算与AI推理部署、具备项目管理或技术方案撰写经验或有成功主导AI项目从0到1落地的案例等情况优先。","ClassificationOne":"计算机软件类","ClassificationTwo":"浙江","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-20T18:03:33","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"12af16ce-bcf9-48ae-a491-f741c8e42d46","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151127323,"PostDateInt":1768442556000,"PostDate":"2026-01-15T10:02:36","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"仓储主管(J12394)","OrgId":1486877,"Org":"珠海冠宇电池股份有限公司","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·珠海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"【工作职责】\n1.负责制订物料仓库作业程序及管理制度，完善仓库各项流程和标准；\n2.负责监督仓库物料的先进先出及追溯；\n3.负责物料仓单据的审核；\n4.负责组织月度物料仓的